N5008 [expr.prim.pack.index]/1-2: pack-index-expressions over a function
parameter pack -- the first of three, the sole element of a one-element pack,
`ts...[sizeof...(ts) - 1]` (the index is a converted constant expression),
two indexings in one expression, and in a constexpr function folded by a
static_assert.  Non-vacuous: the last assertion states a wrong value and must
FAIL.  (No host compiler here implements C++26 pack indexing; the expected
values follow the wording.)
